docs {
  # Update Item
  
  Partial update of field values on an existing item.
  
  **Method:** PATCH  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/api/v1/collections/{{collection_slug}}/items/{{item_id}}`  
  **Auth:** Bearer inherit  
  **Permission:** `update`
  
  ---
  
  ## Body
  
  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "title": "Updated title"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Response (200)
  
  Updated item payload.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Cause |
  |--------|-------|
  | 403 | No `update` grant |
  | 404 | Unknown collection or item |
  | 422 | Validation failed |
}
